{"id":"633998","name":"木耳肉末苋菜包","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633998/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"野苋菜","amount":"750g"},{"name":"肉糜","amount":"300g"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"温水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3g"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"一把"}],"sub":[{"name":"干面粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面盆里放酵母。","img":"images/633998/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放温水，把酵母溶化。","img":"images/633998/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放面粉，揉成面团。","img":"images/633998/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放一边发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/633998/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"野苋菜。","img":"images/633998/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一棵一棵抖着洗一洗。","img":"images/633998/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"焯水。","img":"images/633998/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"冷水浸泡。","img":"images/633998/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"泡好的木耳冷水下锅。","img":"images/633998/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把木耳煮开锅5分钟。","img":"images/633998/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"反复清洗，沥干水分。","img":"images/633998/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"切末。","img":"images/633998/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"葱姜切末。","img":"images/633998/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放一起。","img":"images/633998/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"热锅冷油，油热放肥肉糜。","img":"images/633998/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"把肉糜炒焦黄。","img":"images/633998/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"把野菜攥干水分。","img":"images/633998/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"切末。","img":"images/633998/step_18.jpeg"},{"step":19,"desc":"放热锅里，加食盐和生抽。","img":"images/633998/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"放肉糜。","img":"images/633998/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"放葱姜和木耳及鸡精。","img":"images/633998/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"关火，拌匀即可。","img":"images/633998/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"发好的面放干面粉揉光排气。","img":"images/633998/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"分成剂子。","img":"images/633998/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"擀皮。","img":"images/633998/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"包包子。","img":"images/633998/step_26.jpg"},{"step":27,"desc":"放蒸笼里二次发酵。","img":"images/633998/step_27.jpg"},{"step":28,"desc":"发好的包子大火烧开。中火蒸20分钟关火焖5分钟即可。","img":"images/633998/step_28.jpg"},{"step":29,"desc":"靠近锅边的都蒸上锅巴啦，这个锅巴最香了。","img":"images/633998/step_29.jpg"},{"step":30,"desc":"开动吧。","img":"images/633998/step_30.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}